# Practice safety checks

## Rate your confidence with the exit plan
as: rating
style: stars

1: I need help
2: I can find one exit
3: I can find both exits

## Rate how ready you feel to respond
as: rating
style: slider

1: I need help
2: I need more practice
3: I can follow the plan
4: I can guide a coworker

## Write your personal action plan
as: free-response
private: true
downloadAs: both
required: true
description: Name one exit you will check today and when you will check it.
